        IF order EQUALS `s 672.76(2)(b) direct that the application of a placement decision or a disposition made under paragraph 672.54(b) or (c) be suspended pending the appeal` THEN (IF `the decision under appeal is a placement decision or a disposition made under paragraph 672.54(b) or (c)` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING)   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a placement decision or a disposition made under paragraph 672.54(b) or (c)"
