        IF order EQUALS `s 672.76(2)(c) make any other disposition pending the appeal` THEN (IF `the application of the disposition is suspended pursuant to section 672.75 or paragraph 672.76(2)(b)` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE)   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "where the application of a disposition is suspended pursuant to section 672.75 or paragraph (b)"
