-- 672.77: where the application of a disposition or placement decision appealed from is suspended, a disposition, or in the absence of a disposition any order for the interim release or detention of the accused, that was in effect immediately before the disposition or placement decision appealed from took effect,
-- shall be in force pending the determination of the appeal, subject to any disposition made under paragraph 672.76(2)(c).
-- src:13891 | 672.77 Where the application of a disposition or placement decision appealed from is suspended, a disposition, or in the absence of a disposition any order for the interim release or detention of the accused, that was in effect immediately before the disposition or placement decision appealed from took effect, shall be in force pending the determination of the appeal, subject to any disposition made under paragraph 672.76(2)(c).
@ref s 672.77 (src:13891)
DECLARE `s 672.77 what is in force pending the appeal` IS ONE OF
    `s 672.77 a disposition made under paragraph 672.76(2)(c)`
    `s 672.77 the disposition that was in effect immediately before the decision appealed from took effect`
    `s 672.77 the order for the interim release or detention of the accused that was in effect immediately before the decision appealed from took effect`
    `s 672.77 not covered`

@ref s 672.77 (src:13891)
GIVEN `the application of the disposition or placement decision appealed from is suspended` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a disposition was in effect immediately before the decision appealed from took effect` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an order for the interim release or detention of the accused was in effect immediately before the decision appealed from took effect` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a disposition has been made under paragraph 672.76(2)(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 672.77 what is in force pending the appeal`
`s 672.77 what is in force pending the determination of the appeal` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the application of the disposition or placement decision appealed from is suspended` THEN `s 672.77 not covered`   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Where the application of a disposition or placement decision appealed from is suspended"
        IF `a disposition has been made under paragraph 672.76(2)(c)` THEN `s 672.77 a disposition made under paragraph 672.76(2)(c)`
        IF `a disposition was in effect immediately before the decision appealed from took effect` THEN `s 672.77 the disposition that was in effect immediately before the decision appealed from took effect`
        IF `an order for the interim release or detention of the accused was in effect immediately before the decision appealed from took effect` THEN `s 672.77 the order for the interim release or detention of the accused that was in effect immediately before the decision appealed from took effect`
        OTHERWISE `s 672.77 not covered`   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): no earlier disposition or order is shown to have been in effect

-- 672.78(1): the court of appeal may allow an appeal against a disposition or placement decision and set aside an order made by the court or Review Board, where the court of appeal is of the opinion that (a) it is unreasonable or cannot be supported by the evidence;
-- (b) it is based on a wrong decision on a question of law; or (c) there was a miscarriage of justice.
-- fork: F-GRANT-WHERE
